<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-048" chapter-id="c-nanshi-048-luchui-sons" source-id="s-nanshi-048-luchui-sons-ws2493997">
  <p id="c-nanshi-048-luchui-sons:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-048-luchui-sons:p001:m0000" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">梁武帝</persName>雅愛<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luchui-sons:p001:m0005" ref="war_qdw_fs5">倕</persName>才，乃敕撰新漏刻銘，其文甚美。遷太子中舍人，又詔為石闕銘，敕褒美之，賜絹三十匹。累遷太常卿，卒。子<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luchui-sons:p001:m0055" ref="war_qdw_fs5_A">纘</persName>早慧，七歲通經，為童子郎，卒。次<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luchui-sons:p001:m0072" ref="war_qdw_fs5_B">緬</persName>，有似於<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luchui-sons:p001:m0077" ref="war_qdw_fs5">倕</persName>，一看殆不能別。</p>
</text>
